.TH JUST-A-LINE-NEXT 7 "2026" "Just a Line Next" "Community Software"

.SH NAME
Just a Line Next - an actively maintained continuation of Google's
original Just a Line project.

.SH DESCRIPTION
Just a Line is no longer actively developed.

Just a Line Next continues its journey by bringing the original
experience to modern Android versions while introducing new features,
improvements, and a refreshed interface.

The goal is not to replace what made Just a Line special, but to
preserve its original spirit while keeping the project alive,
compatible, and enjoyable for the future.

.SH DEVELOPMENT
This project continues the original software through ongoing
maintenance and development.

New updates focus on:

.IP (bu 2
Modern Android compatibility.

.IP (bu 2
Material Design and Material Expressive interface improvements.

.IP (bu 2
New drawing and brush styles.

.IP (bu 2
Improved functionality and usability.

.IP (bu 2
Localization and language support.

.IP (bu 2
Ongoing bug fixes and maintenance.

.IP (bu 2
New features inspired by the original Just a Line experience.

.SH PHILOSOPHY
Software does not have to disappear simply because its original
development has stopped.

Just a Line Next exists to continue the journey.

.SH DISCLAIMER
This is an independent community continuation of the original
Just a Line project and is not affiliated with, endorsed by,
or officially maintained by Google.

.SH MOTTO
Keeping Just a Line Alive.
